/**
 * Logical asset registry — the only place that knows real file names.
 *
 * Paths are relative to `/assets/` (served from `public/assets`, generated by
 * scripts/sync-assets.mjs from the original Sprites/ folder).
 * `tests/assets-registry.test.ts` asserts every path listed here exists in the
 * generated manifest, keeping the usage matrix (docs/assets/ASSET_USAGE_MATRIX.md)
 * truthful.
 */

